      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I tested this with you in a world yesterday, and I was unable to reproduce this memory leak with particle lights using your public avatar with 1000 max lights.\n\nSpecifically, while my 16 GB VRAM was fully utilized temporarily during particle lights spam, allocated RAM didn't go up by more than a few GB and staid stable there for consecutive tests.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
